{"unit_id":"Shaw529__dsh-token-saver#feature-1","repo":"Shaw529/dsh-token-saver","commit":"0576ed39bda492989ce410fc064593323a89b6b3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-saver 的功能「大型工具结果头尾折叠」：工具返回内容超过配置预算时，保留开头和结尾并以省略标记替代中间部分。工具执行后自动处理，可配置字节预算及按行边界保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/strategies/tool-result-trim.ts:97-157","src/lib/truncate.ts:25-77"]}
{"unit_id":"Shaw529__dsh-token-saver#feature-2","repo":"Shaw529/dsh-token-saver","commit":"0576ed39bda492989ce410fc064593323a89b6b3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-saver 的功能「grep 结果折叠」：识别 grep 类工具输出并保留匹配行及其上下文，同时限制匹配数量和最终字节预算。功能在工具执行后自动触发，结果会标出被省略的行或额外匹配。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/strategies/tool-result-trim.ts:113-120","src/lib/fold-grep.ts:54-120"]}
