{"unit_id":"Shaw529__dsh-token-saver#feature-4","repo":"Shaw529/dsh-token-saver","commit":"0576ed39bda492989ce410fc064593323a89b6b3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-saver 的功能「提示段稳定排序」：注册到 system prompt 段处理器后，把可缓存或用户指定为稳定的段排在易变段前，并按稳定标记和原始位置排序。这样可使固定提示部分在多次请求中保持靠前。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-92","src/strategies/prompt-cache.ts:14-39"]}
